inl certified_arithmetic_prime_power_structural_factor_witness_make forall factor count product.
    (power : certified_arithmetic_prime_power factor count product) :
    certified_arithmetic_prime_power_structural_factor_witness factor count product =
    match certified_arithmetic_prime_power_run power with
